Third-party material that *is* here
-----------------------------------

Runtime and build dependencies are declared in `package.json` and resolved by `pnpm`; each carries
its own licence, and none are vendored into this tree.

Exercise demonstration media is fetched at runtime from
`github.com/nekodas-neko/exercises-dataset` and is not part of this repository.


Not medical advice
------------------

This is a personal training and health tracker. The figures it derives are estimates from consumer
sensors. It is not a medical device and must not be used to diagnose, treat or monitor any
condition.
